# Folder synchronization after a stopped run (specs/003-folder-sync US8). Run after 16-sync-stopped.walk with the same server and folders: the pair says how far the run
# got, nothing was started again by itself, and the next sync finishes what was left and ends as an uninterrupted one.
size 1404 1872
waitfor homeState Connected to Example Cloud
tap homeSync
waitfor syncPairRow
wait 500
# quickstart step 5, the start-up half: the Books pair has Sync at start on, so the app compared it when it started (a plan is ready, nothing was changed by it)
# and it did not run any plan by itself; the other pairs have the switch off and were left alone
expect syncPairState Plan ready
expect syncPairState In sync
expect syncPairState 0 of 1 done
shot @OUT@/128-interrupted.png
tap syncPairRow 2
wait 400
tap choiceRow 0
waitfor planApprove
tap planApprove
waitfor resultCounts downloaded
shot @OUT@/129-result-after-interruption.png
expect resultCounts failed
tap resultDone
waitfor syncPairRow
expect syncPairState In sync
tap syncBack
wait 300
